  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Cinema?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/39/Cinema.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219113957\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cinema\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Building</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>rep</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"rep\"><img alt=\"rep\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1c/Reputation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141647\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Rep. lvl(s) 2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4,500</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>cinema</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">service building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reputation</a> level 2 in the player's <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a>.\n</p><p>A cinema is the same as a movie theater.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The appearance of the cinema changes as the player upgrades it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACinema_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Cinema Stage 1.png (393 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/72/Cinema_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028123154\" title=\"Cinema Stage 1.png (393 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema Stage 1.png (393 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACinema_Inside_1.png\" title=\"Cinema Inside 1.png (366 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/77/Cinema_Inside_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713203552\" title=\"Cinema Inside 1.png (366 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema Inside 1.png (366 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACinema_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Cinema Stage 2.png (404 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Cinema_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713203553\" title=\"Cinema Stage 2.png (404 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema Stage 2.png (404 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACinema_Inside_2.png\" title=\"Cinema Inside 2.png (365 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b5/Cinema_Inside_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713203552\" title=\"Cinema Inside 2.png (365 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema Inside 2.png (365 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ACinema.png\" title=\"Cinema.png (6.37 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/39/Cinema.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240219113957\" title=\"Cinema.png (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema.png (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACinema_Inside.png\" title=\"Cinema Inside.png (375 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d5/Cinema_Inside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713202552\" title=\"Cinema Inside.png (375 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema Inside.png (375 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>The cinema costs 4,500 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 5 hours and 30 minutes (or 37 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to build.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Serving</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>When the cinema is at level 1, it takes 3 hours&#160;(or 6&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to serve a customer and 11 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> are awarded.</li>\n<li>Serving time can be reduced to 1 hour and 48 minutes at most.</li>\n<li>Points can be increased to a maximum of 18 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> per customer.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The folllowing materials are required to upgrade the cinema.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3AHammer.png\" title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/81/Hammer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131656\" title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Hammer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Hammer.png (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Hammer\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammer</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ANail.png\" title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Nail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028130907\" title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Nail\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Nail\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nail</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AWood_Panel.png\" title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Wood_Panel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131042\" title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Wood panel\" height=\"144\" width=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Wood panel\" height=\"144\" width=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wood panel</a></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Orders</b></span></h3>\n<p>Customers visiting the cinema usually require products from the:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/coffee-kiosk-3564\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coffee Kiosk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/hot-dog-stand-19439\" title=\"Hot Dog Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hot Dog Stand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/ice-cream-maker-3560\" title=\"Ice Cream Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ice Cream Maker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/juice-press-3559\" title=\"Juice Press\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Juice Press</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-kitchen-20183\" title=\"Pasta Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Kitchen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/popcorn-pot-3551\" title=\"Popcorn Pot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Popcorn Pot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/smoothie-mixer-11369\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Smoothie Mixer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/taco-kitchen-24828\" title=\"Taco Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Taco Kitchen</a></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammers</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Beach Café</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Shop</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Hall</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nails</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wood panels</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Silo</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tackle Box</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<p>The trailer seen in the cinema references two famous movies:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The title, <i>Finders of the Lost Farm</i>, is a reference to <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raiders_of_the_Lost_Ark\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Raiders of the Lost Ark\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Raiders of the Lost Ark</a></i> from the Indiana Jones series.</li>\n<li>The catchphrase, <i>When your farm is lost, and it don't look good, who ya gonna call?</i> references <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghostbusters\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Ghostbusters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ghostbusters</a></i>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bf/Beach_Caf%C3%A9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113615\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/bed-and-breakfast-13194\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Bed_and_Breakfast.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113856\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cinema-13193\" title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/39/Cinema.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113957\" title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/diner-13192\" title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/19/Diner.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219114114\" title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5b/Gift_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713204537\" title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/grocery-store-13191\" title=\"Grocery Store (465 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7e/Grocery_Store.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926034449\" title=\"Grocery Store (465 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store (465 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa (7.83 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/eb/Spa.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219114322\" title=\"Spa (7.83 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Spa (7.83 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829042318\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.117 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 566/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2455/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 103/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 19019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usag